    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrown into a world consumed by infection, a lone cube-shaped survivor awakens with no memory, no guidance, just instincts and the need to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>______________________________________________________________</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/ecc173f501182a21326d9ba8ee2f0dea.poster.avif?t=1754678242\" width=786 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/ecc173f501182a21326d9ba8ee2f0dea.webm?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/ecc173f501182a21326d9ba8ee2f0dea.mp4?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Cube Slayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, top-down endless 2D survival shooter where you fight through waves of relentless zombies in ever-expanding infected maps. Armed only with random weapons at the start, you must collect experience from fallen enemies to level up and unlock stronger, deadlier versions of your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the tougher the horde becomes. Every second is a challenge. Every kill is progress. Level up, choose from three random upgrades, and stack weapon evolutions to create devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When death finally comes--<strong>and it will</strong>--your run ends, but your progress doesn\u2019t. Use collected resources to purchase permanent buffs, unlock new maps, and uncover hidden Easter eggs scattered throughout the infected world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the while, something\u2026 watches. A mysterious figure lurks in the distance, silent, motionless, and always there. What is it? Why is it watching you? Will it encounter you? And why were you dropped into this world in the first place?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prepare for chaos, mystery, and high replayability. How long can you survive\u2026 and how far can you go before the truth catches up to you?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you find the snakes?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/9cf3fa225ea0e00af10fc2829698578e.poster.avif?t=1754678242\" width=598 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/9cf3fa225ea0e00af10fc2829698578e.webm?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/9cf3fa225ea0e00af10fc2829698578e.mp4?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level you can choose your new weapon or stack different weapons to make powerful combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/bc1b70390da3a25e17725a5e9b2e3ce3.poster.avif?t=1754678242\" width=642 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/bc1b70390da3a25e17725a5e9b2e3ce3.webm?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/bc1b70390da3a25e17725a5e9b2e3ce3.mp4?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrown into a world consumed by infection, a lone cube-shaped survivor awakens with no memory, no guidance, just instincts and the need to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>______________________________________________________________</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/ecc173f501182a21326d9ba8ee2f0dea.poster.avif?t=1754678242\" width=786 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/ecc173f501182a21326d9ba8ee2f0dea.webm?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/ecc173f501182a21326d9ba8ee2f0dea.mp4?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Cube Slayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, top-down endless 2D survival shooter where you fight through waves of relentless zombies in ever-expanding infected maps. Armed only with random weapons at the start, you must collect experience from fallen enemies to level up and unlock stronger, deadlier versions of your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the tougher the horde becomes. Every second is a challenge. Every kill is progress. Level up, choose from three random upgrades, and stack weapon evolutions to create devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When death finally comes--<strong>and it will</strong>--your run ends, but your progress doesn\u2019t. Use collected resources to purchase permanent buffs, unlock new maps, and uncover hidden Easter eggs scattered throughout the infected world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the while, something\u2026 watches. A mysterious figure lurks in the distance, silent, motionless, and always there. What is it? Why is it watching you? Will it encounter you? And why were you dropped into this world in the first place?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prepare for chaos, mystery, and high replayability. How long can you survive\u2026 and how far can you go before the truth catches up to you?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you find the snakes?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/9cf3fa225ea0e00af10fc2829698578e.poster.avif?t=1754678242\" width=598 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/9cf3fa225ea0e00af10fc2829698578e.webm?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/9cf3fa225ea0e00af10fc2829698578e.mp4?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level you can choose your new weapon or stack different weapons to make powerful combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/bc1b70390da3a25e17725a5e9b2e3ce3.poster.avif?t=1754678242\" width=642 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/bc1b70390da3a25e17725a5e9b2e3ce3.webm?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775870/extras/bc1b70390da3a25e17725a5e9b2e3ce3.mp4?t=1754678242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
